{"id":"659228","name":"上汤苋菜","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/659228/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"青苋菜","amount":"一把"},{"name":"皮蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"猪肉","amount":"80g"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜","amount":"2瓣"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"苋菜清洗干净。","img":"images/659228/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"皮蛋切小块，蒜切片。","img":"images/659228/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"适量的肉末。","img":"images/659228/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"起锅烧油，爆香蒜片。","img":"images/659228/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入肉末。","img":"images/659228/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"肉末炒至变色，倒入皮蛋。","img":"images/659228/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"皮蛋炒香。","img":"images/659228/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入适量的开水，汤汁煮至浓白。","img":"images/659228/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入苋菜。","img":"images/659228/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"苋菜煮软后，加入盐和胡椒粉调味即可。","img":"images/659228/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659228/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}